sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Player
  participant UI as Raid UI
  participant Start as StartRaid
  participant Raid as Raid Aggregate
  participant Chase as ChaseService
  participant Graffiti as GraffitiRuleService
  participant Score as GhostScoreService
  participant Ghost as GhostRepository
  participant Rewards as ClaimRewards

  Player->>UI: Select fortress
  UI->>Start: execute(fortressId)
  Start->>Raid: create and initialize
  Raid-->>UI: initial raid state
  Player->>UI: Move, jump, wall-grab, slide
  UI->>Raid: record action
  Player->>UI: Activate limited graffiti
  UI->>Graffiti: apply effect
  Graffiti-->>Raid: route/shortcut/trap effect
  Player->>UI: Trigger detection
  UI->>Chase: start chase
  Chase-->>Raid: expose alternative routes
  Player->>UI: Choose alternative route
  UI->>Chase: validate route
  Chase-->>Raid: escape accepted
  Player->>UI: Steal and extract
  UI->>Raid: complete heist
  UI->>Score: calculate outcome
  Score->>Ghost: read recorded attempt
  Ghost-->>Score: ghost run
  Score-->>UI: score, breakdown, silhouette
  Player->>UI: Claim rewards
  UI->>Rewards: execute
  Rewards-->>UI: treasure, reputation, progression
